That's not strange; any level may have a "Magic Memory Vault" (an
isolated 2x2 room full of gold). Some (not all) vaults have teleporters
leading to them. If you "hear someone counting money" or "hear the
footsteps of a guard on patrol" there's a vault on the level, if you
"hear someone searching" it's already been robbed (by you, or a rock
mole or leprechaun).

That the guard led you to the excact spot where you'd started from is
pure coincidence.

